{"id":"vod_md_2477","vodId":"2477","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"一起一起这里那里","name_cn":"一起一起这里那里","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230815-1/9f8ec678755bbbde83207722f4b3c5f9.jpg"},"summary":"御庭摘希（大久保瑠美 配音）是一个有着紫色长发和呆毛的傲娇少女，个性呆萌又别扭的她有着一个心上人——音无伊御（冈本信彦 配音）。在伊御的眼中，摘希是一个需要照顾的小妹妹，这让摘希觉得十分抓狂。虽然完全没有自觉，但是伊御时常会做出一些让摘希无法承受的刺激举动。围绕着这一对友达以上恋人未满的笨蛋情侣的，是一群有趣又善良的朋友们。天然呆的春野姬（福原香织 配音）总是被爱捉弄人的科学怪人片濑真宵（生天目仁美 配音）耍得团团转；而有着僵硬症的戌井榊（浅沼晋太郎 配音）又总是在笑料达到高潮的时刻浑身僵直不能动弹。这群可爱的朋友们，围绕着他们而展开的日常就是这部动画所要表达的主要内容。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-15 08:02:58","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/ZWgL1qdU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/EDj06d8j/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/enVc7VM7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/WBkaoHre/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/caukdia6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/MKc67C4T/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/a2EdEz0C/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/k7B4LQjS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/9Cxfujm0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/BBVGNgGL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/8951exJX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/3IxDz8NE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230813/sG5lraFH/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:16.073Z"}